Help: config  ? / esc to close  6–10 of 10                                                       
                                                                                                 
hidereviewed    nohidereviewed    nohidereviewed    hide hunks marked reviewed from the diff pane
autoviewed      noautoviewed      noautoviewed      reviewing a file's last hunk marks it viewed 
hideresolved    nohideresolved    nohideresolved    hide resolved threads from the diff pane     
skipresolved    noskipresolved    noskipresolved    make ) and ( pass over resolved threads      
relativenumber  norelativenumber  norelativenumber  number diff rows by distance from the cursor 
